OL,3,AWebsites taken down across Europe ahead
OL,4,Aof critical cyber-security update
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finnish government, Edinburgh
OL,7,Fcouncil and the BBC are among those to
OL,8,Fhave taken down sites and pages down
OL,9,Fahead of a software update to a
OL,10,Fprogramming language which underpins
OL,11,Fmany online services.
OL,13,FTwo critical vulnerabilities with the
OL,14,FPHP programming language, which is
OL,15,Fwidely used across the internet, have
OL,16,Fbeen identified - with a fix issued for
OL,17,Fthem on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,19,FMultiple cyber-security agencies have
OL,20,Furged organisations to rapidly adopt
OL,21,Fthe updates, or consider taking their
OL,22,Fwebsites offline.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
