OL,3,AWebsites taken down across Europe ahead
OL,4,Aof critical cyber-security update
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinland has temporarily shut down the
OL,7,Fgovernment's public web services, while
OL,8,Fthe Netherlands' cyber-security agency
OL,9,Fsaid it was taking its own website
OL,10,Foffline due to the vulnerabilities.
